# Context Router

Spec: ContextRouter
Purpose:
  Map task intent to affected components and knowledge domains.

Input:
  intent:        <natural language or structured intent>
  affected_area: <component path>

Routes:
  BACKEND     → skills/backend, architecture/backend, DDD/domain-services
  DATABASE    → skills/databases, architecture/data, migrations
  API         → skills/api, architecture/networking, contracts/openapi
  QA          → skills/testing, architecture/observability
  SECURITY    → skills/security, governance/capabilities
  DEVOPS      → skills/platforms, architecture/deployment
  FRONTEND    → skills/frameworks/frontend, architecture/presentation

Rules:
  [CR-01] Router MUST output component list, not load content.
  [CR-02] Router MUST include parent domains (e.g., BACKEND → DOMAIN).
  [CR-03] Router MUST exclude unrelated domains.

Navigation:
  Parent: @../INDEX.sdd
  Skills: @../../skills/INDEX.sdd
  Architecture: @../../architecture/INDEX.sdd

State: +
